    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are hotlines, but they don't change how i feel. they don't change the fact that i'm just... done. like, everyone says \"it gets better\" but i don't want it to get better. i just want it to be over. it feels like such a logical conclusion to everything i've been through. everything just feels so pointless now.",
